WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.480
A detective faces the suspect.

2
00:00:02.530 --> 00:00:05.430
Suppose you were in the
library at nine p m.

3
00:00:05.480 --> 00:00:08.140
Then the security camera would show you.

4
00:00:08.190 --> 00:00:09.230
It doesn't.

5
00:00:09.280 --> 00:00:10.740
So you weren't there.

6
00:00:10.790 --> 00:00:12.520
Now try it in maths.

7
00:00:12.570 --> 00:00:17.180
Suppose the square root of three is a
fraction… You start from something you expect

8
00:00:17.230 --> 00:00:18.400
to be false.

9
00:00:18.450 --> 00:00:20.040
How can that prove anything?

10
00:00:20.090 --> 00:00:21.980
Do two wrongs make a right?

11
00:00:22.030 --> 00:00:24.690
Or does it only make the answer likely?

12
00:00:24.740 --> 00:00:27.980
In this mission, you'll write
proofs by contradiction.

13
00:00:28.030 --> 00:00:31.310
First, assume the negation
of the statement you want.

14
00:00:31.360 --> 00:00:36.080
Then use valid steps to reach a
contradiction: something impossible.

15
00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:39.370
You'll use facts like this:
written in lowest terms,

16
00:00:39.420 --> 00:00:42.340
p over q has no common factor.

17
00:00:42.390 --> 00:00:47.390
Your mission: explain how assuming
something false can prove something true.
